{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 对人物行为动机的解释不如 Y 充分，尤其 S06 对想念与安全感的联系、S11 对暂缓回去的理由，Y 交代得更自然明确。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的加亮短语让普通观众即使不逐字阅读，也能迅速抓住每段叙事重点；话与感受交替排列，加上感受按音乐节点出现，比较容易形成连续的观看和聆听体验。Y 的优势是部分心理动机解释得更充分，短词也便于快速掠读，但右侧标签在 S03、S06、S07 等段落过于密集，容易让细腻的情绪变成一份需要逐项辨认的清单。整体而言，X 更容易让人既听见音乐的变化，又跟上人物内心的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c384d9a7-0357-49b5-82a0-358a60efccb8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031211604132Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:13:01.838384+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "da824e120617eaf984563c28312f2eb2ee4c6d51ed0d641d94404faaccae5a44", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c